ely stripped the heavy stuff out. This version is built for pure, raw performance. 0 FPS drops.\n\nFeatures:\n\nRaw Performance ESP: Just clean Boxes and Distance [meters]. No heavy raycasting, no lag. Boxes turn Neon Cyan when you lock onto a target so you know exactly who you're shooting.\n\nNo-Shake Aimbot (RMB): Added a proper mathematical deadzone. The aimbot actually sticks to the head without spazzing out or vibrating. Includes 0.045 velocity prediction and wallbang support.\n\nModal UI Fix: If you play FPS games where the camera locks your mouse, you know the struggle. I added a true modal unlocker so your custom Gojo-Purple cursor glides smoothly over the UI without the game fighting you.\n\nLite-Fullbright: Clean ambient lighting, no deep-fried white screens.","tags":["esp","radar","aimbot","fov"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/4wSrrJEb","keyLink":"https://linkvertise.com/3601903/RAYjp5C0VXV7?o=sharing","owner":{"_id":"69996e323c999592ac9eb137","username":"HumanoidPremium","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4adc16ca600a48f0d69d8b1317a81c8029f9c27533f411cbbbec1da34bc57901.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69996e323c999592ac9eb137-1776404299001.png"},"lvl":14,"status":"offline","id":"69996e323c999592ac9eb137","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":25},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4adc16ca600a48f0d69d8b1317a81c8029f9c27533f411cbbbec1da34bc57901.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69996e323c999592ac9eb137-1776404299001.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-23T02:30:54.220Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69dbaed9391dc2f659507359","editBy":{"_id":"69996e323c999592ac9eb137","username":"HumanoidPremium","status":"offline","id":"69996e323c999592ac9eb137"},"message